        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p key="P_description_0" contentType="Description">A gene coding for an aldehyde/alcohol dehydrogenase in C. acetobutylicum! (in C. beijerinckii is missing -> activates ethanol production?)                see Molecular characterization of an aldehyde/alcohol dehydrogenase gene from Clostridium acetobutylicum ATCC 824: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC205125/</p></body>
        </notes>
