            <p key="P_description_0" contentType="Description">PTS converts carbohydrates into phosphoesters; containing genes: ptsI, ptsH, hprK, manIIAB, manIIC (X276_23240, X276_02985), manIID (X276_23235, X276_02990), manIIB, manIIA</p></body>
